uten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/10893/10893.jpg\" alt=\"塩原温泉　割烹旅館　湯の花荘 外観・メインイメージ\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/10893/10893_rm.jpg\" alt=\"塩原温泉　割烹旅館　湯の花荘 客室・館内イメージ\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-3\">\n      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-stone-200\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs\">\n          <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-200 bg-white\">\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900 w-32\">正式名称</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-stone-900\">塩原温泉　割烹旅館　湯の花荘 （施設番号: 10893）</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">所在地・住所</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3\">栃木県那須塩原市塩原323</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">交通アクセス</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3\">東北自動車道　西那須野塩原ＩＣよりＲ４００で２０分。那須塩原駅よりＪＲバスにて50分、塩釜温泉下車。（最寄り：那須塩原駅）</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">駐車場情報</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3\">有り　40台　無料　先着順</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">参考最安料金</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-extrabold text-red-600 text-sm\">¥41,800〜 <span class=\"text-[11px] font-normal text-stone-500\">（※季節・曜日・人数により変動）</span></td>\n            </tr>\n            \n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200\">\n        <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-950 block mb-1\">✨ 宿の公式アピールポイント</span>\n        <p class=\"text-stone-800\">客室は全て渓流に面